# airflow/dags/
#
# Purpose: Apache Airflow DAG definitions for orchestrating the ML pipeline.
#
# DAGs that will be added in Milestone 10:
#   - churn_training_dag.py   — end-to-end training pipeline
#   - churn_retraining_dag.py — scheduled retraining on drift signal
#
# Requirements: Apache Airflow is NOT installed in the base environment.
# It will be added as a separate Docker service in Milestone 9.
